Project requirements: {{requirements}}
Audience: {{audience}}
Technology constraints: {{technology}}
Visual direction: {{direction}}

Extract typography, spacing, hierarchy, layout and feedback rules from the selected reference and apply them to my requirements. Keep the project’s own content and brand. Do not treat demo data or frontend-only actions as real services. When a design specification is selected, it determines visuals and the interface reference informs structure and interaction.
